Subject: split out derived data
Message-ID: <xTiqc88g29w.LQJ5DyrO10QJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <xTiqc88g29w.NZUfIJqyEx8J@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
